# The team works on Windows with core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout.
# A shell script with CRLF endings fails inside a Linux container with a misleading
# "no such file or directory" — the shell reads the \r as part of the interpreter path.
# Docker entrypoints have to stay LF no matter what platform checks them out.
*.sh text eol=lf
